# Data Understanding

## Dataset

Sample Superstore

## Source

Internal ERP Sales Export

## Description

The dataset contains historical retail sales transactions from multiple regions across the United States.

Each record represents a customer order.

## Data Includes

- Customer Information
- Product Information
- Sales
- Profit
- Discount
- Quantity
- Order Date
- Shipping Details
- Geographic Information

## Measures

- Sales
- Profit
- Quantity
- Discount

## Dimensions

- Customer
- Product
- Category
- Region
- State
- Segment
- Order Date

## Data Quality Review

The following checks will be performed:

- Missing values
- Duplicate records
- Invalid dates
- Incorrect data types
- Negative profit values
- Blank customer names
